## 1. POS Sessions

### 1.1 Liste des sessions de caisse

**Méthode :** `GET`  
**URL :** `/api/pos/sessions/`  
**Auth :** Oui (Bearer token)  
**Org filter :** Oui (header `X-Current-Org-Id`)

**Query params (optionnels) :**
- `warehouse` — filtrer par entrepôt/magasin
- `status` — filtrer par statut (`open` | `closed`)
- `date_from` — filtrer par date d'ouverture (ISO date)
- `date_to` — filtrer par date d'ouverture (ISO date)

**Réponse attendue :**
```json
{
  "results": [
    {
      "id": "uuid",
      "session_number": "S-2026-001",
      "warehouse": { "id": "uuid", "name": "Magasin Centre-Ville" },
      "cashier": { "id": "uuid", "full_name": "Jean Dupont", "email": "jean@example.com" },
      "status": "open",
      "opening_float": "50000.00",
      "closing_float": null,
      "expected_cash": null,
      "cash_difference": null,
      "opened_at": "2026-04-27T08:00:00Z",
      "closed_at": null,
      "notes": "Ouverture matinale",
      "total_sales": null,
      "sales_count": null,
      "total_cash": null,
      "total_card": null,
      "total_mobile_money": null
    }
  ]
}
```

**Champs calculés (pour sessions fermées) :**
- `total_sales` — somme des ventes de la session
- `sales_count` — nombre de ventes
- `total_cash`, `total_card`, `total_mobile_money` — totaux par méthode de paiement
- `expected_cash` — `opening_float + total_cash`
- `cash_difference` — `closing_float - expected_cash`

